 "description": "<p>Nine tapping modes run this rose's working surface — tapping being the quick percussive register between a buzz and a thump, delivered through a head shaped to cup its target. The tapping vocabulary suits users who find continuous vibration numbing and suction too slow to build.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_63275801-82cf-4545-8399-b009aef02812_480x480.jpg?v=1693015113\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>IPX7 waterproofing covers full submersion, so baths and deep cleaning both sit inside the rated envelope rather than at its edge. The sealed body also means soap-and-water washing is the whole maintenance routine.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_5ce32d1b-a1ea-44f3-96e6-80d59e65860a_480x480.jpg?v=1693015103\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>USB magnetic charging handles power with the usual no-port convenience, and the discreet silhouette reads as a desktop object rather than a drawer object — the minor design point that affects where a toy actually lives.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_fa357b2e-b19b-4a44-bb02-e7575777d7d1_480x480.jpg?v=1693015106\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Modes: 9 tapping-vibration patterns</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7, submersible</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Design: discreet, compact</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_36b5ae2f-39ef-4622-a0d4-41474f1a3033_480x480.jpg?v=1693015109\"></p>\n<p>Between the nine patterns and the submersion rating, the toy covers both the sensation and the maintenance side of ownership without a single accessory to lose. The tapping register, sealed for soaking — a specific sensation, properly packaged.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose licking vibrator with 9 tapping-vibration modes, IPX7 submersion rating, USB magnetic charging and a discreet desktop-safe silhouette.</p>\n",
